        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you know how to beat this level? Think again.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here again. Same room. Same door. But each time — a completely different puzzle. Welcome to the sequel of the indie game that will flip your perception of logic games upside down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 <strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That Level Again 2 is a minimalist puzzle game where the same level becomes dozens of different challenges. Our hero is still trying to escape, but now even more devious and unexpected obstacles await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⭐ <strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>70+ unique solutions</strong> — each playthrough requires a new approach</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deceptive simplicity</strong> — minimalist design hides genius puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-gameplay</strong> — play with your expectations and gaming conventions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor and absurdity</strong> — unexpected twists and hilarious solutions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and secrets</strong> — for the most attentive explorers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for streaming</strong> — viewers love giving hints (though not always the right ones!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧩 <strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget everything you know about platformers. Here, jumping can kill you, standing still might open the door, and sometimes the solution lies beyond the game field itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[spoiler] Experiment with everything: controls, physics, even the game settings![/spoiler]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new level is the same visual set: hero, platforms, door, and button. But the rules change every time. What worked a minute ago will now lead to failure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📖 <strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our nameless hero is stuck in an endless loop of identical rooms. The only way out is a door that stubbornly refuses to open the usual way. Can you help him find freedom? Or perhaps freedom is just an illusion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💡 <strong>WHO IS THIS GAME FOR?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovers of unconventional puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of the first game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those tired of repetitive indie games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamers and their viewers</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime:</strong> 2-4 hours of intense brainstorming</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That Level Again 2 isn't just a game — it's a challenge to your thinking. Are you ready to accept it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember: the obvious solution almost never works. 🚪</p>",
